  encoder residual after the round trip: -77 usteps (-6.0 counts)
    A few counts is quantisation plus gear backlash. Tens of
    counts is real lost motion, and the places to look are
    the encoder hub and the gear mesh.

  [ ok ] the encoder tracks the ramp to within 0.0%, which
    confirms 1000 CPR against 51200 usteps/rev. A ratio near 2 or
    0.5 would mean the fitted encoder is not the CPR this
    firmware was told about.


